  "text": {
    "stem": "<p>A student stands still on a force plate, bends their knees, and then jumps straight up. The force plate records the vertical force $F$ on it 200 times per second. The student lands back on the plate with bent knees.</p><p>The graph shows the force recorded by the plate.</p>",
