    {
      "label": "c",
      "question": "The push starts at $t = 0.10\\ \\text{s}$. Estimate the impulse of the resultant force on the student from then until the student leaves the plate.",
      "marks": 3,
      "markscheme": [
        "Resultant force $= F - mg$: uses the area between the graph and a horizontal line at the weight ✓",
        "Up to take-off at $t = 0.50\\ \\text{s}$ (where $F$ reaches zero); the area below the weight line near take-off is subtracted ✓",
        "Impulse $\\approx 150\\ \\text{N s}$ (accept 140 to 160 N s) ✓"
